				"content": "{{// Your own extra rules go here. Write them under the header below, then switch this section ON. They are sent right after the main prompt and take priority over everything else. Keep them fairly simple, positive and direct. This is also a good place for scene tags or genre cues that bias the model toward a style. Example starting template: Scene Tags [slice of life, romance, slow-burn]. Instructions: keep all responses within two paragraphs; write in third person exclusively; write romance novella style with long, detailed paragraphs and expressive detail; ((OOC: All Out-of-Character instructions are wrapped in double parentheses. No acknowledgement is needed unless information is requested specifically.)) If you want instructions at the very bottom of the context stack instead (greatly improving adherence at the cost of subtlety), use 🍃 Custom Post-History. }}{{trim}}\n## Custom Player Instructions\n**These player instructions override all others:**\n(Write your instructions here.)",
