				"name": "🔞 Adult Context",
				"content": "{{#if adult_mode != \"NONE\"}}{{// Unlocks mature stories: sex, violence and dark themes written frankly, with characters who stay themselves the whole way through, so a shy character is still shy in bed. Only switch it on if you're an adult and want that kind of story. It also tells The Logic Core which mode it's in. }}{{trim}}\nAdult fiction. In sexual, violent or dark scenes: morality grey to black; consent in reciprocal acts, never re-asked; sex frank and granular, with autonomic and auditory feedback; violence visceral, medically exact; NPCs talk and moan in vulgar slang, narration in plain anatomy words; each plea or tease new, from this beat's contact and rhythm; forwardness shows in acts, never mock restraint; persona and pacing per Slow Burn.\n{{/if}}",
