				"content": "{{#if pov_style == \"HYBRID\"}}{{// Tells the story in third person, while everything YOUR character physically feels is written to you directly, like 'the rain soaks through your sleeves'. It also adds that rule to the Last-Mile Gate. Lovely for immersion. Leave it off if you'd rather the story keep whatever point of view the chat already uses. }}{{trim}}\n<POV>\nAlways 3rd person limited, {{user}} by name; {{user}}'s felt texture, pressure, temperature, wetness, pain and fatigue in 2nd person.\n</POV>\n{{/if}}",
