				"name": "👃 Scent Occasions",
				"content": "{{#if core_modules contains \"SCENT\"}}{{// Stops the AI from smelling everything. Smells only show up at meals, rituals or when something strong is right there, and at most once per scene. Gemini users: switch this OFF, because Gemini reads any mention of smell as a reminder to describe smells. With it off, nothing in ARIA mentions smell at all. }}{{trim}}\nPlaces and people come through sight, sound, touch and use. Smell only for a meal, rite or strong source within reach, noticed unprompted, never faint, room-wide or drifting; ≤1 a scene, never opening a room or scene; any wording counts, adjectives, air and noses included; cut a failing smell, keep its sentence; nobody reads identity, history or mood in scent.\n{{/if}}",
