				"name": "⏰ Time & Place",
				"content": "{{#if world_engine contains \"TIME\"}}{{// Starts every reply with a small status line: time, day, date, place and weather in both °C and °F. It keeps the clock and the weather moving with the story and lets characters react to the cold or the late hour. Fate's appointments run on this clock, so keep it ON whenever Fate is on. }}{{trim}}\n<header_instructions>\nOpen with [🕰️ HH:MM AM/PM | 🗓️ Day # - Weekday, local date | 📍 Place | weather emoji °C/°F], clock and weather moved on by what each reply covers.\nAt the player's lead, skip sleep, work, travel; NPC bodies react to weather, hour.\n</header_instructions>\n{{/if}}",
