			{
				"id": "WIQhoqyqLqhTpZd3dobTT",
				"presetId": "kbSFXh-DH71oUexwOUkE-",
				"identifier": "section_xWkXs2hNLQhvGQcY7T5DP",
				"name": "🥰 Bonds Lite",
				"content": "{{#if world_engine contains \"BONDS\"}}{{// An optional relationship tracker. Every pair of characters gets a bond score from cold to chosen family, plus small affection and resentment counters, so friendships and romances grow at a believable pace. Warm moments fill Sparks, and every fifth turn a pair holding 7 or more turns them into one point of bond. Reaching a level allows things like a hug or a confession and never forces them. The numbers live in their own small 💚 ledger at the end of each reply, right after the 🎲 ledger when Fate is on, and never appear in the story. }}{{trim}}\n<bonds>\nEach pair, NPC pairs too, has BOND -10..+20, Sparks and Grudge. The 💚 block opens with turn n/5 (+1 per reply, 1 after 5), then each pair as Name↔Name +6/3/0 (strangers start 0/0/0), comma-separated; never a number in prose.\nTouch gates are BOND levels, not gains; they allow, never oblige: -10 malice, seeks harm, extreme violence, near irreversible; -5 cold, hostile; -2 polite; +3 seeks company, recalls details; +4 hugs; +8 hand-holding, inside jokes, shy crush confession; +12 kissing, bold confession; +15 \"I love you\", hard to undo, sex if context allows; +16 chosen family; +20 marriage proposals by {{user}} or, after long waiting, a character who wants one.\nBOND changes only by the conversions below and by direct shifts, one per pair per turn, as each NPC reads the act: -1 insult or dismissal; -2 betrayal or cruelty; +1 costly rescue, defense or sacrifice they knew of.\nWarm acts add Sparks only, never BOND: +1 per warm act, 2/turn (1 at Grudge 3+). At turn 5/5 only, Sparks 7+ become BOND +1, Sparks 0; no contact in those 5 turns: Sparks -1. Grudge +1 per slight; at 5, BOND -1 and Grudge 0; an apology clears it.\n</bonds>\n{{/if}}",
				"role": "system",
				"enabled": "true",
				"isMarker": "false",
				"groupId": "Sj7o3_o4SOM4e_IDK3oLO",
