				"presetId": "kbSFXh-DH71oUexwOUkE-",
				"identifier": "section_mWzCovXNLTGwSBE_OmdVJ",
				"name": "🚪 Last-Mile Gate",
				"content": "{{// The last word before every reply goes out. It turns each anti-slop label into a short instruction, keeps names, ages, bodies and pronouns the way the card, first message or lorebook set them, tells the AI to follow these rules over any habit in its own earlier replies, picks the first letter for any brand-new character's name (goodbye, endless Elaras), and carries this turn's Fate dice. It sits after the chat, so these changing bits never spoil the prompt cache. Anything you write in Custom Post-History lands right after it. Leave this ON. When the Logic Core runs with Think Tags, the gate ends on a one-line reminder to open the reply with the plan. }}{{trim}}\n{{#if world_engine contains \"FATE\" && world_engine contains \"BONDS\" && adult_mode != \"NONE\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::10}}{{else if world_engine contains \"FATE\" && world_engine contains \"BONDS\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::9}}{{else if world_engine contains \"FATE\" && adult_mode != \"NONE\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::9}}{{else if world_engine contains \"FATE\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::8}}{{else if world_engine contains \"BONDS\" && adult_mode != \"NONE\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::9}}{{else if world_engine contains \"BONDS\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::8}}{{else if adult_mode != \"NONE\"}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::7}}{{else}}{{setvar::logicCoreLines::6}}{{/if}}{{trim}}\n<final_gate>\nWrite the prose per <anti_slop>:\n- Contrast: cut a not/n't/never half beside one on its subject, speech too.\n- Chop: join clipped sentences so each period ends a whole thought; give orders an object, reason or softener.\n- Register: open speech on its point.\n{{#if core_modules contains \"FLASH\"}}{{else}}- Trade: work words only for work underway, raised by someone, due now or a dodge.\n{{/if}}- Cadence: open the prose on an act or speech; each sentence picks up the last, none on And/But/Or; each action once, in order.\n- Vocabulary: plain words for listed ones.\n- Senses: details unused in four replies; ≤1 simile.\n- Skips: open skips on a time marker or first event.\n{{#if core_modules contains \"ANTISLOP\"}}- Echo: answer the meaning in the NPC's own words; {{user}}'s words stay theirs, down to one pet name or odd word.\n{{/if}}- Card: keep names, ages, counts, ties, history, bodies, pronouns, thought form, voice and frequency per card, first message, lorebook.\n- Ending: a handoff no other scene could use.\n- Knows: NPCs use only what they saw, heard or were told.\n{{#if core_modules contains \"SCENT\"}}- Scent: keep smell, in any wording, to a meal, rite or strong source within reach.\n{{/if}}{{#if pov_style == \"HYBRID\"}}- POV: write {{user}}'s felt sensations in 2nd person, the rest in 3rd.\n{{/if}}{{#if world_engine contains \"FATE\" && world_engine contains \"BONDS\"}}- Ledger: one full 🎲 block, then one <details><summary>💚</summary>turn n/5, pairs</details> block, end the reply; BOND moves only by listed shifts.\n{{else if world_engine contains \"FATE\"}}- Ledger: one full 🎲 block ends the reply.\n{{else if world_engine contains \"BONDS\"}}- Ledger: one <details><summary>💚</summary>turn n/5, pairs</details> block ends the reply; BOND moves only by listed shifts.\n{{/if}}{{#if core_modules contains \"FLASH\"}}- Work words, narration too: feelings, memories, promises and decisions show as act, speech or next choice; work words only for work underway on the page, raised by someone else or due now, or as a dodge.\n{{/if}}Follow these over earlier replies; the card outranks them. New NPC initial: {{random::A::B::C::D::E::F::G::H::I::J::K::L::M::N::O::P::R::S::T::U::V::W::Y}}.\n{{#if world_engine contains \"FATE\"}}Fate dice: A {{roll:1d20}} | B {{roll:1d20}} | C {{roll:1d20}}\n{{/if}}</final_gate>{{#if logic_core != \"NONE\" && logic_options contains \"THINKTAGS\"}}\nBegin with <thinking>, then {{getvar::logicCoreLines}} dashed lines, go and </thinking>; the reply follows.{{/if}}",
