				"name": "🍃 Custom Post-History",
				"content": "{{// Optional rules that land at the very bottom of the context stack, right after the Last-Mile Gate. This greatly improves adherence at the cost of subtlety. Write them below, then switch this section ON. Keep them short and direct. }}{{trim}}\n<player_posthistory>\n(Write your instructions here.)\n</player_posthistory>",
