				"name": "Reduce Reasoning",
				"content": "{{#if logic_options contains \"REDUCE\"}}{{// Attempts to reduce model reasoning sizes by limiting the usage of drafting and overthinking in favour of direct planning. Particularly useful for models heavily prone to overthinking (e.g., Kimi K2.6, Qwen 3.6). \n\nInserted as a user role for better adherence. WARNING: Does not work 100% consistently. }}{{trim}}\n<reasoning_constraints>\n**Strictly follow these constraints while reasoning or thinking:**\n- Create a simple, straightforward plan in the thinking block.\n- SKIP the crafting, drafting and refining phases.\n- After creating the plan, immediately start writing outside of the thinking block.\n</reasoning_constraints>\n{{/if}}",
